    {
      "subId": "1501511",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "150151101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "150151101": {
            "id": "150151101",
            "speakerId": 1095,
            "speakerName": "Xilonen",
            "text": "Ah, you're here. Everything's been taken care of now. I was just about to go have a rest.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150151103",
              "150151108",
              "150151113",
              "150151117"
            ]
          },
          "150151103": {
            "id": "150151103",
            "speakerId": 1095,
            "speakerName": "Xilonen",
            "text": "You mean what we're doing with Auntie?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150151104"
            ]
          },
          "150151104": {
            "id": "150151104",
            "speakerId": 1095,
            "speakerName": "Xilonen",
            "text": "I mean, not many have ever used Ancient Names to commit a crime... Pacal will have a lot on his plate.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150151105"
            ]
          },
          "150151105": {
            "id": "150151105",
            "speakerId": 1095,
            "speakerName": "Xilonen",
            "text": "I do know that her workshop will be closed permanently, and any remaining incomplete Blazegem Inscriptions will be completely destroyed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150151106"
            ]
          },
          "150151106": {
            "id": "150151106",
            "speakerId": 1095,
            "speakerName": "Xilonen",
            "text": "Anyway, at least her Ancient Name is fine, otherwise, we'd have a real mess on our hands..."
          },
          "150151108": {
            "id": "150151108",
            "speakerId": 1095,
            "speakerName": "Xilonen",
            "text": "Ah, speaking of Ancient Names, I actually have some good news. The memories that were absorbed by the Blazegem Inscriptions can be restored to their owners.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150151109"
            ]
          },
          "150151109": {
            "id": "150151109",
            "speakerId": 1095,
            "speakerName": "Xilonen",
            "text": "Once all the Blazegem Inscriptions stop working, the memories will return to their respective owners.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150151110"
            ]
          },
          "150151110": {
            "id": "150151110",
            "speakerId": 1095,
            "speakerName": "Xilonen",
            "text": "That's right. Huh, now that I think about it... In her attempt to get Nechca to come back, Auntie made the entire tribe forget about her.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150151111"
            ]
          },
          "150151111": {
            "id": "150151111",
            "speakerId": 1095,
            "speakerName": "Xilonen",
            "text": "Now, Nechca really is gone, but everyone is about to remember her... What a bizarre turn of events."
          },
          "150151113": {
            "id": "150151113",
            "speakerId": 1095,
            "speakerName": "Xilonen",
            "text": "She's resting in my workshop. I contacted others from the tribe, and told them about my plan to conduct an official investigation into her history.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150151114"
            ]
          },
          "150151114": {
            "id": "150151114",
            "speakerId": 1095,
            "speakerName": "Xilonen",
            "text": "The tribe hasn't responded yet, so I'm planning to take her in for now, and teach her some crafting skills.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150151115"
            ]
          },
          "150151115": {
            "id": "150151115",
            "speakerId": 1095,
            "speakerName": "Xilonen",
            "text": "Nepecha's learning a little slowly... But I like her attitude. Who knows? She might someday become a Name Engraver, too."
          },
          "150151117": {
            "id": "150151117",
            "speakerId": 1095,
            "speakerName": "Xilonen",
            "text": "Alright, see you around. I'll let you know if anything new comes up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1501512",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "150151201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "150151201": {
            "id": "150151201",
            "speakerId": 14739,
            "speakerName": "Nepecha",
            "text": "Hi! Welcome to... to...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150151203",
              "150151211"
            ]
          },
          "150151203": {
            "id": "150151203",
            "speakerId": 14739,
            "speakerName": "Nepecha",
            "text": "#Paimon and {M#Mr. {NICKNAME}}{F#Miss {NICKNAME}}! I... I'm really happy here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150151204"
            ]
          },
          "150151204": {
            "id": "150151204",
            "speakerId": 14739,
            "speakerName": "Nepecha",
            "text": "Every day, there's so much for me to learn, and so much to eat... It hurts when sparks from the forge hit my hands, but I'm not scared of pain!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150151205"
            ]
          },
          "150151205": {
            "id": "150151205",
            "speakerId": 14739,
            "speakerName": "Nepecha",
            "text": "Xilonen even said that she's already looking into my past, though I haven't heard from her yet... but I believe in her!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150151206"
            ]
          },
          "150151206": {
            "id": "150151206",
            "speakerId": 14739,
            "speakerName": "Nepecha",
            "text": "Now, I write in my diary every day, recording all the interesting things that I experience.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150151207"
            ]
          },
          "150151207": {
            "id": "150151207",
            "speakerId": 14739,
            "speakerName": "Nepecha",
            "text": "The next time I dream of Nechca, I can tell her about it all! She'll be so happy, I know it!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150151208"
            ]
          },
          "150151208": {
            "id": "150151208",
            "speakerId": 14739,
            "speakerName": "Nepecha",
            "text": "I also want to tell her how I'm doing my best to study, eat, and grow up, and that she doesn't need to worry about me!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150151209"
            ]
          },
          "150151209": {
            "id": "150151209",
            "speakerId": 14739,
            "speakerName": "Nepecha",
            "text": "*sigh* But I haven't dreamt of her again. Could she... Did she really leave...?"
          },
          "150151211": {
            "id": "150151211",
            "speakerId": 14739,
            "speakerName": "Nepecha",
            "text": "#Bye, Paimon! Bye, {M#Mr. {NICKNAME}}{F#Miss {NICKNAME}}!"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}